        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sequel to UNI, UNI 2 has returned bigger and better than ever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNI 2 is a casual party game featuring 35 unique mini games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooters, puzzles, racing, arcade, action, platformers, and more — a wide variety of genres packed into one game for everyone to enjoy easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in addition to local 2-player battles with friends, UNI 2 also supports a single-player mode where you can challenge high scores on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy quick matches anytime,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or keep challenging yourself to beat your best records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and intuitive rules, players of all ages can jump right in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect party game to enjoy with family, friends, or your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge records alone,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or compete and laugh together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 unique mini games – Every match feels fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports both single-player and 2-player battle modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls – Easy for anyone to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player mode focused on high score challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun local party gameplay with friends and family</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute graphics and flashy visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between normal music and classical music BGM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More free mini game updates planned for the future</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended For Players Who</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a casual game to enjoy solo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a fun 2-player game for friends or family</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want quick but satisfying gameplay sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy local multiplayer games with simple controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love score attacks and replayability</p></li></ul>",
